{"unit_id":"MlittleFriend__dsh-character-profiler#feature-1","repo":"MlittleFriend/dsh-character-profiler","commit":"9417ad1a6d084a29c7e050c39afb823cbbce3273","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-character-profiler 的功能「角色性格侧写」：根据人物卡和相关正文段落生成结构化档案，包含性格维度、动机、说话风格与一致性红线，并写到 lore/profiles。通过 novel_profile 触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:33-59","lib/profile.js:25-76"]}
